      "content": "SP 8607 10/206 WENDOVER AYLESBURY ROAD west side No.7. GV II House. C17 altered C18. Timber framed, upper part faced in painted stucco, lower underbuilt in painted brick. Old tile roof with high central chimney, 2 storeys upper formerly oversailing. 2 bay front, 2-light casements to 1st floor, central door, 2-light casement to LH larger window to RH all with segmental arches. RCHM 1 p.309 MON.29. Listing NGR: SP8694407930"
    }
